# Stage 1 of the thrash statistic is a trailing MEDIAN filter, and it is what removes
# single-interval artifacts (banshee-s4d). Measured case: quitting a 6.5 GB browser
# produced a 6394 ops/sec burst as the kernel tore the working set down — real churn,
# but caused BY the remediation, so letting one interval set the band would tell
# someone their fix failed at the moment it worked.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/mod.rs
test: a_single_isolated_thrash_spike_does_not_pin_the_band
---OLD---
            (at, vals[vals.len() / 2])
---NEW---
            (at, points[i].1)
